\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Exact rank-heterogeneous aggregation for one adapted layer (glyph widths are proportional to the rank). (a)~Each client uploads factors of its own rank $r_k$; the server forms the change $\Delta _k$ of the client's product relative to what the client received. (b)~The weighted mean change is added to the current global product; the result $M$ is re-factorized by a truncated SVD at rank $r_{\max }$, and the remainder $R$ is folded into the frozen weight, so the effective model equals the aggregate of \cref  {prop:exact}. (c)~A device of rank $r_k$ receives the leading $r_k$ singular directions.}}{3}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:aggregation}{{2}{3}{Exact rank-heterogeneous aggregation for one adapted layer (glyph widths are proportional to the rank). (a)~Each client uploads factors of its own rank $r_k$; the server forms the change $\Delta _k$ of the client's product relative to what the client received. (b)~The weighted mean change is added to the current global product; the result $M$ is re-factorized by a truncated SVD at rank $r_{\max }$, and the remainder $R$ is folded into the frozen weight, so the effective model equals the aggregate of \cref {prop:exact}. (c)~A device of rank $r_k$ receives the leading $r_k$ singular directions}{figure.2}{}}
\newlabel{fig:aggregation@cref}{{[figure][2][]2}{[1][3][]3}{}{}{}}
